{"src":"en","tgt":"ko","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ko","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7705.041302,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":9600.240626,"text":"‘내셔널 트레저’ 영화를 본 적이 있다면, 독립선언문 뒷면에 보물 지도가 적혀 있을 거라고 생각할지도 모릅니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":9780.375253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9785.337198,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":9790.919933,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9796.000277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9801.300907,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9804.281576,"samples":19504,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":13874.311949,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":15103.932250000002,"text":"이 핫초콜릿은 벨기에 기준에 부합합니다. 과일 주스는 비싸지만, 시간이 지나면 그 달콤함을 느낄 수 있게 됩니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":15200.089025000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":15204.926863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15207.603757,"samples":18613,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"audio","t":15225.176458000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15230.193593,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15236.171991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15238.683688000001,"samples":19281,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":22206.175372,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":23520.65009,"text":"하지만 그건 사실이 아닙니다. 그 문서의 뒷면에는 무언가 적혀 있지만, 그것은 보물 지도가 아닙니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":23586.788676,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23589.338452,"samples":19616,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"audio","t":23635.001566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23640.125589,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23645.274941,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23650.594041,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":23650.923135,"samples":2396,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":29976.15938,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":31449.405568,"text":"자국 정부 이외의 다른 나라 정부의 조언도 참고할 수 있지만, 그들의 조언은 자국민을 위해 마련된 것입니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":31605.900757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31610.645846000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31615.966616,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":31621.398894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31626.601964999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31630.012697000002,"samples":20897,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":41277.592017999996,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42961.642611999996,"text":"홍콩섬은 홍콩이라는 지명의 유래가 된 곳이며, 많은 관광객들이 가장 중요하게 여기는 곳이기도 합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":43134.849237,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43139.838412,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43145.176041,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":43151.28524700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43156.598367,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43161.37405499999,"samples":29814,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"input","t":49090.285479,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50974.549839,"text":"고위도 지역이나 산악 도로에서 운전할 사람은 눈, 얼음, 또는 미끄러운 도로 상황의 가능성을 반드시 고려해야 합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":51142.763708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":51148.606879,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":51154.13415500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51159.485464,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51164.606747,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":51170.131093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51175.71322799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":51175.991033,"samples":222,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":58774.268331,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59654.511012999996,"text":"분리와 재조합을 통해 변이가 두 풀 사이를 오갑니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":59740.359133000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59743.649408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59746.319692000005,"samples":27808,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"input","t":61179.418703,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61788.848491,"text":"세대가 진행될수록 그렇게 됩니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":61847.140939000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61851.497275,"samples":29925,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"input","t":66503.410723,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67905.13120799999,"text":"곤충학자들은 이 곤충 집단을 지칭할 때 형식적인 의미에서 ‘버그’라는 용어를 사용합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":68031.50695899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":68036.418496,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68041.576458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68047.129223,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68051.96939099999,"samples":30260,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"input","t":74687.43665999999,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":76414.323536,"text":"먼저, 대부분의 라이더들은 굽이 있고 밑창이 매끄럽고 상당히 좁은 승마용 부츠를 신습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":76541.32871599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76546.222153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76552.182342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76557.278545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76562.545036,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":76562.89331,"samples":3622,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":83903.306522,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":85077.45204599999,"text":"이 위원회는 10월에 시작된 대규모 반정부 시위에 대한 마르텔리의 대응이었습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":85186.940105,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85191.74973299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85196.829436,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85202.063447,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85203.01542099999,"samples":8804,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":91129.067163,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":92142.233465,"text":"소방대원들은 결국 밤 11시 35분경에 불을 진압했습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":92238.830733,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":92243.845608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92249.090858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92253.62061099999,"samples":23461,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":97354.79831,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98520.921821,"text":"대서양 허리케인 시즌의 강력한 폭풍인 아열대성 폭풍 제리."},{"kind":"audio","t":98618.02948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":98622.907307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98628.03128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98631.76153599999,"samples":19281,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":100223.030768,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100691.342125,"text":"오늘 대서양에서 발생했습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":100745.969786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100749.680213,"samples":24631,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":107227.62013,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":108503.641133,"text":"이로 인해 우리는 자동차와 그 밖의 많은 교통 수단을 훈련시키게 되었습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":108607.405088,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108610.81434,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":108614.031836,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108617.260191,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":108617.503097,"samples":4625,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116613.99836299999,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117936.608433,"text":"서기 400년경에 시작되어 오랫동안 이어진 고급 브랜드들의 중심지로 유명합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":118046.83007899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":118051.966651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118057.155533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118062.483093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118064.25900199999,"samples":13263,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":120739.412224,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121406.951173,"text":"서기 1100년경까지 이어졌습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":121470.436563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":121475.33967999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":121475.748183,"samples":1337,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":127060.309302,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127935.48083,"text":"달의 표면은 암석과 먼지로 이루어져 있습니다. 달의 외부 층을 지각이라고 합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":128033.803768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128039.00855,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128040.59856299999,"samples":12482,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"audio","t":128044.587785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128047.15293099999,"samples":26303,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":800},{"kind":"input","t":134203.798962,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135554.156281,"text":"미국 공병대는 6인치의 강우량만으로도 이전에 손상된 부분이 무너질 수 있다고 추정했습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":135714.994886,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":135719.74256500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135725.10572400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135730.845196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135736.08492700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135736.744706,"samples":7244,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":141175.354537,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142887.749879,"text":"특히, 미세한 표정을 올바르게 해석함으로써 사람이 거짓말을 하는지 여부를 판단할 수 있다고 합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":143063.167216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143068.252469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143073.5013,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143078.886139,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143084.021431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143088.19086,"samples":26192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":840},{"kind":"input","t":147228.95449,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":148205.208512,"text":"건물에 낙서를 하거나 긁어서 시설을 훼손하지 마십시오."},{"kind":"audio","t":148294.82039900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148299.62022,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148305.287236,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":148305.615251,"samples":2563,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":154864.388837,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156578.487918,"text":"호랑이의 울음소리는 사자의 웅장한 울음소리와는 다르며, 더욱 거칠고 으르렁거리는 소리에 가깝습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":156734.941475,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156739.818164,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156745.276405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156751.00200100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":156756.052697,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156761.32106100002,"samples":32322,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"input","t":161904.68196500003,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":163442.507014,"text":"20세기의 연구에 따르면, 숨겨진 형태와 드러난 형태의 두 가지 유전적 변이가 존재한다고 합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":163579.072548,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":163584.05119600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163589.32959900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163594.64561200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163600.06769300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":163600.395637,"samples":1950,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":173706.75992100002,"code":1005}]}